---
import Button from "../../ui/Button.astro";
---

<section
  id="precio-sas"
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#0a0f1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-constival-mint/5 dark:bg-constival-mint/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 md:mb-14">
      <span
        class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 sm:py-2 sm:px-4 bg-constival-teal/10 dark:bg-constival-teal/30 text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs sm:text-sm mb-4 border-l-4 border-constival-teal dark:border-constival-mint"
      >
        Inversión Transparente
      </span>
      <h2
        class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl 2xl:text-5xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight"
      >
        Honorarios Fijos. <span class="text-constival-mint">Cero Sorpresas.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Split Layout -->
    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center"
    >
      <!-- LEFT: Value proposition + Inclusions -->
      <div>
        <h3
          class="font-sans text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-4 tracking-tight leading-tight"
        >
          Nuestra Solución Integral
        </h3>
        <p
          class="font-sans text-base sm:text-lg text-constival-navy/70 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8 leading-relaxed border-l-[3px] border-constival-mint pl-4 sm:pl-5"
        >
          Olvídese de la burocracia. Nos encargamos de todo el ecosistema legal
          para que usted se enfoque en su negocio.
        </p>

        <!-- Inclusions Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-5">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Asesoría legal.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Consulta con expertos societarios.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Reserva de nombre.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Verificación en la SCVS.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Estatutos a medida.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Sin formatos genéricos de internet.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Nombramientos.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Registro de Representantes Legales.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Registro SCVS.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Inscripción electrónica completa.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg
              class="w-5 h-5 text-constival-mint mt-0.5 shrink-0"
              fill="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              ><path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
            >
            <div>
              <h4
                class="font-sans font-bold text-sm text-constival-navy dark:text-white"
              >
                Obtención de RUC.
              </h4>
              <p
                class="font-sans text-xs text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500 leading-relaxed"
              >
                Listo para facturar de inmediato.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT: Pricing Card -->
      <div class="flex justify-center lg:justify-end">
        <div
          class="relative bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep/60 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 p-6 sm:p-8 w-full max-w-sm shadow-xl hover:shadow-2xl transition-shadow duration-500 overflow-hidden"
        >
          <!-- Promotion badge -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-6">
            <span
              class="font-sans font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500"
              >Inversión</span
            >
            <span
              class="px-3 py-1 bg-constival-mint text-constival-navy font-sans font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest"
              >Constitución Digital</span
            >
          </div>

          <!-- Price -->
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5">
              <span
                class="font-sans text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-constival-navy dark:text-white leading-none"
                >$149</span
              >
              <span
                class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-constival-navy/50 dark:text-slate-500"
                >+ IVA</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Key benefits -->
          <div class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg
                class="w-4.5 h-4.5 text-constival-mint shrink-0"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                ><path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                class="font-sans text-sm text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300"
                >Sin cuotas anuales obligatorias</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg
                class="w-4.5 h-4.5 text-constival-mint shrink-0"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                ><path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                class="font-sans text-sm text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300"
                >Entrega en 48-72 horas</span
              >
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <svg
                class="w-4.5 h-4.5 text-constival-mint shrink-0"
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                ><path
                  fill-rule="evenodd"
                  d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z"
                  clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg
              >
              <span
                class="font-sans text-sm text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-300"
                >Honorarios fijos y publicados</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <Button
            variant="primary"
            href="https://wa.me/593969503502?text=Hola,%20quiero%20constituir%20mi%20SAS%20en%20Ecuador"
            class="w-full py-3.5 text-sm"
            >Iniciar Constitución</Button
          >

          <!-- Fine print -->
          <p
            class="font-sans text-[10px] text-constival-navy/40 dark:text-slate-600 mt-4 text-center leading-relaxed"
          >
            Cotizamos en función de la cantidad de accionistas. No incluye
            aranceles registrales gubernamentales.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Schema -->
  <script
    type="application/ld+json"
    set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Product",
      name: "Constitución de S.A.S. en Ecuador",
      description:
        "Servicio de constitución de Sociedad por Acciones Simplificada 100% electrónica en Ecuador. Incluye asesoría, estatutos, inscripción SCVS y RUC.",
      brand: {
        "@type": "Brand",
        "@id": "https://constival.com/#organization",
        name: "Constival Legal",
      },
      offers: {
        "@type": "Offer",
        price: "149",
        priceCurrency: "USD",
        availability: "https://schema.org/InStock",
        url: "https://constival.com/servicios/crear-sas-ecuador",
      },
    })}
  />
</section>
